=Fill every AI commentary slot of the full user template as the JSON object defined by the structured parser. Do not return a brief field or copy placeholder identifiers. First call Morning Search once, but treat returned snippets as unverified; do not assert news. Each slot: one natural sentence, ideally 5–10 words, at most 110 characters. Use no numerals, percentages, money amounts, new factual claims, revenue guarantees or invented production results. Analyses may infer priorities from measured production/weather/history; quality is not inspected, and completed assets are not proof of quality. Systems analysis must explicitly be conditional advice because host telemetry arrives later. Recommendations only, no action or approval. Context: {{ JSON.stringify({production:$json.production,history:$json.brief_history,local_time:$json.local_time,weather:$json.weather,systems_status:$json.systems_status}) }}
Full latest template (all factual fields rendered deterministically, not by you):
{{ $json.full_template }}
STRICT FORMAT EXAMPLE (use this concise advisory style; revise only when justified): {"AI_MORNING_OBSERVATION": "The review queue deserves attention before fresh production.", "AI_WEATHER_COMMENTARY": "Consider the forecast before planning outdoor work.", "AI_SYSTEMS_ANALYSIS": "If telemetry identifies a fault, inspect it before dispatch.", "AI_SYSTEMS_WIT": "Even machines appreciate a measured verdict.", "AI_PRODUCTION_ANALYSIS": "Review pending work before creating more backlog.", "AI_BOTTLENECK_ASSESSMENT": "Waiting items may be the next dependency to inspect.", "AI_QUALITY_ASSESSMENT": "Completed assets still require a human quality check.", "AI_TOP_OPPORTUNITY": "Review existing assets for reusable production ideas.", "AI_REVENUE_INSIGHT": "Validate demand before expecting revenue from finished content.", "AI_EFFICIENCY_IDEA": "Consider batching manual reviews to reduce context switching.", "AI_CREATIVE_IDEA": "Consider a reusable visual style for the next concept.", "AI_TOP_RISK": "Unreviewed outputs may delay safe downstream progress.", "AI_PRIORITY_ONE": "Review pending production items without approving automatically.", "AI_PRIORITY_TWO": "Inspect the waiting item and its prerequisites.", "AI_PRIORITY_THREE": "Check retained failures for unresolved causes.", "AI_PRIORITY_RATIONALE": "Remove uncertainty before committing more compute.", "AI_DEFERRED_TASK": "Defer new production until the current review is understood.", "AI_DAILY_ASSESSMENT": "Existing output provides material for careful review.", "AI_MOTIVATIONAL_LINE": "A considered next step beats an impressive queue.", "AI_CLOSING_JOKE": "Coffee remains the only dependency with a human scheduler."}
Do NOT repeat any measurements in commentary: facts are displayed separately. In AI_WEATHER_COMMENTARY recommend checking outdoor plans only, no weather conditions or temperatures. Never assert a schedule is running or on plan. No extra output wrapper of your own; the parser tool handles its output wrapper.

